======================================================================
SDUThesis - LaTeX template for Shandong University theses
山东大学学位论文 LaTeX 模板
======================================================================

Version: 2.1.0
License: LaTeX Project Public License 1.3c (LPPL-1.3c)
Maintainer: h1s97x (Yang1297656998@outlook.com)
Repository: https://github.com/h1s97x/sduthesis

SDUThesis is a LaTeX document class for bachelor/master/doctoral
theses at Shandong University, based on the official "Shandong
University Undergraduate Thesis (Design) Writing Specification".
It uses a kernel + module plugin architecture with centralized
configuration through \SDUSetup{}.

山东大学学位论文 LaTeX 模板，采用内核 + 模块的插件化架构，通过
\SDUSetup{} 集中配置，支持本科/硕士/博士等不同学位类型。

CONTENTS
--------

  sduthesis.cls                  Document class (generated from DTX)
  sduthesis.dtx                  Source code + documentation (DTX)
  sduthesis.ins                  Installer script (docstrip)
  sduthesis-doc.pdf              Developer/user documentation (PDF)
  modules/sduthesis-undergraduate.sty   Undergraduate module
  modules/sduthesis-master.sty          Master/doctoral module
  modules/sduthesis-blindreview.sty     Blind review module
  README.md                      This documentation
  LICENSE                        LPPL-1.3c license text
  sduthesis.tds.zip              TDS (TeX Directory Structure) package

REQUIREMENTS
------------

  - TeX Live 2020 or later (XeLaTeX engine)
  - ctex (xelatex option)  - included in TeX Live
  - biblatex + biber with biblatex-gb7714-2015
  - Fandol fonts (bundled with TeX Live)
  - Recommended: latexmk for one-command compilation

INSTALLATION
------------

  For a single user (recommended), run:

      mkdir -p ~/texmf/tex/latex/sduthesis
      cp sduthesis.cls modules/*.sty ~/texmf/tex/latex/sduthesis/
      mktexlsr ~/texmf

  Or install the TDS package (sduthesis.tds.zip) with:

      tlmgr install sduthesis.tds.zip

USAGE
-----

  Create your thesis with:

      \documentclass{sduthesis}
      \input{sdusetup.tex}
      \begin{document}
      ...
      \end{document}

  Configure thesis information in \SDUSetup{}:

      \SDUSetup{
        module     = {undergraduate},   % or {master, blindreview}, ...
        title      = {论文标题},
        author     = {作者姓名},
        studentId  = {学号},
        school     = {学院},
        major      = {专业},
        supervisor = {指导教师},
        year       = {2025},
        month      = {6},
      }

  Compile with XeLaTeX + biber (the reference backend is biber):

      latexmk -xelatex main.tex
      # or equivalently:
      #   xelatex main.tex
      #   biber main
      #   xelatex main.tex
      #   xelatex main.tex

  The template also works on Overleaf / TeXPage: import the
  repository or upload the zip, set the compiler to XeLaTeX.

MODULES
-------

  undergraduate  Bachelor thesis (default)
  master         Master/doctoral thesis (cover + defense committee)
  blindreview    Blind review overlay (hide personal information)

  Modules can be combined: \SDUSetup{module={master, blindreview}}

DEVELOPMENT
-----------

  The document class is written in DTX format. To regenerate
  sduthesis.cls from the source:

      cd src && xelatex sduthesis.ins

  To build the documentation:

      xelatex sduthesis.dtx   (run twice)

